    LLM: 'Keep flexible tiles that match common end values and avoid being stuck without a legal play, while looking for chances to score multiples of five.\n\nPlan sequences that let you chain scoring plays or doubles to take multiple turns in a row and reduce your pip total before the layout becomes tight.\n\nTrack which high-pip tiles and key scoring combinations are still unplayed so you can steer the layout ends to values that are awkward for opponents but favorable to your remaining tiles.',
